{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le08ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Have you ever been to the Great Wall of China? Is it on your bucket list? It has just been voted one of the new wonders of the world. The Chinese built this fortification of stone, brick, tampered earth and other materials to protect their states against raids. Starting in the 7th century, the walls have been built and rebuilt until fairly recently.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le08ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "I have only just returned from a tour there. The huge stone slabs are impressive. How did workers bring them to the site? I'm sure they were not moved easily. They made as large an edifice as anywhere on Earth!<br/><br/>Over the years, watchtowers and troop barracks were erected and other modifications were done. The path along the wall was constructed to be like a paved road. Today, you can enjoy the view while winding through the stunning countryside.", "id": 2, "time": "25000", "image": "engenn10le08ob11re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Being adventurous, I wandered miles and miles along it after leaving the tour in the morning. Was this not more breathtaking than any historic site I had been to? Despite wanting to continue on, I returned to my hotel to soak my aching legs. I have never been more elated and more tired than at that moment.<br/><br/>Up to now, how many have considered trying to walk the 6,000 mile wall? Few I would say. Perhaps this was accomplished by sturdier Chinese soldiers of yore. So far, in modern times, people have only made it a few miles. If you haven't thought about trying this up to now, think it over. It may just turn out to be the walk of a lifetime.", "id": 3, "time": "57000", "image": "engenn10le08ob11re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le08ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le08ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about two connected events or actions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report facts about events or actions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about unusual or unique events in life.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you know about China in general?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What can you see and do there?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nThe Great Wall of China is a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">fortification</span>!\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"conte